1. Hosting kya hai?
Hosting ka matlab hai apni application ko kisi server ya cloud infrastructure par jagah dena, jahan woh run kar sake aur internet se access ho.

Example:
- Render tumhare Node.js backend ko server par host karta hai.
- Vercel tumhare React frontend ko host karta hai.
2. Deployment kya hai?
Deployment ka matlab hai apni application ka code hosting environment par upload/configure karke usko run karne ke liye release karna.

Example:
1. VS Code mein application banayi.
2. GitHub par code push kiya.
3. Vercel par project connect kiya.
4. Vercel ne build karke application deploy kar di.
5. Application live ho gayi.

Real-life example
Hosting = Ghar
Jahan tum rehte ho
Deployment = Ghar mein shift hona
Apna samaan wahan le jaakar setup karna.